SPARKling MuJoCo — sparse and band-dense Cholesky

The algorithms in src/mj-cholesky_sparse.adb and src/mj-cholesky_band.adb
are adapted from MuJoCo 3.14.0, src/engine/engine_util_solve.c, commit
9ecbb9d7b5ee623f54745638d36799ff90e6f7cd. Reduction order and sparse merging
follow engine_util_blas.c and engine_util_sparse.h. The test bridge extracts
the unmodified sparse-solve function and uses its original AVX header.

